@host = https://localhost:7147
@email = person@example.com
@password = Password123!

### Signup: requires an Admin/Instructor session; preserves the caller cookies
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "roles": [3]
}

### Roles: Instructor = 2 (Admin only), Student = 3 (Admin or Instructor)

### Login: returns 200 and sets HttpOnly token cookies; no response body
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Refresh: uses the refresh cookie from the HTTP client cookie jar; no request body
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh-token
